    induction: {"value":"natural","source":{"kind":"manufacturer","name":"Ford Motor Company (From the Road newsroom)","url":"https://www.fromtheroad.ford.com/us/en/articles/2023/all-new-2024-ford-mustang-gt-ready-to-hit-the-track-as-pace-car","asOf":"2026-11-24","note":"Carried over from the earlier card research (2026-11-11, card key aspiration = naturally-aspirated). Ford's release was summarised as calling the standard 480 hp GT 'the most standard power in a naturally aspirated V8-powered Mustang ever'. The card reviewer did not see the words again but found nothing contradicting them (superchargers appeared only as aftermarket kits). Read from search-result summary; page not opened."}},
