    trackRearIn: {"value":64.4,"source":{"kind":"reference","name":"iSeeCars","url":"https://www.iseecars.com/car/2024-jeep-wrangler-dimensions","asOf":"2026-11-24","note":"iSeeCars' 2024 Wrangler dimensions list 'Rear Track 64.4 in' for the '4x4 Rubicon 4dr SUV'. Auto123's 2024 Wrangler 4xe Rubicon X 4-door sheet gives 'Track Width, Rear: 64.4 (in)'. Cars.com shows 63 in and CarExpert (Australian, other model years) 62.9 in (see conflicts). No Stellantis track figure surfaced. Read from search-result summary; page not opened."}},
