    groundClearanceIn: {"value":10.8,"source":{"kind":"reference","name":"The Drive","url":"https://www.thedrive.com/car-reviews/2024-jeep-wrangler-first-drive-review-specs-price-options-impressions","asOf":"2026-11-24","note":"Copied from earlier card research: 10.8 in of ground clearance cited for the 2024 four-door Rubicon in The Drive's first-drive review; a later search summary tied the same 10.8 in to the four-door Rubicon on the standard 33-inch tyres. One other summary attributed 10.8 in to the Sport S instead, so this was marked unconfirmed by the earlier reviewer. AutoPadre's 2024 Rubicon listing (body style unclear) also shows 10.8 in. Jeep's headline 12.9 in is for the 35-inch tyre package and was not used (see conflicts). Read from search-result summary; page not opened."}},
