    wheelbaseIn: {"value":90.9,"source":{"kind":"reference","name":"Autoblog","url":"https://www.autoblog.com/buy/2024-Mazda-MX_5+Miata-Club__2dr_Convertible/specs/","asOf":"2026-11-24","note":"Search summary: 'Autoblog lists it at 90.9 inches, and TrueDelta gives the same figure for both the soft top and the RF'; the Autoblog listing is for the 2024 MX-5 Miata Club 2dr Convertible. No Mazda 2024 figure was seen (the 2024 MX-5 Spec Deck PDF appeared in results but its dimension tables were not shown). Read from search-result summary; page not opened."}},
    trackFrontIn: {"value":58.9,"source":{"kind":"reference","name":"CarExpert (New Zealand)","url":"https://www.carexpert.co.nz/mazda/mx-5/2024/exterior-and-dimensions","asOf":"2026-11-24","note":"Search summary: 'CarExpert's listing gives a front track of about 58.9 in (1495 mm)'. Published in millimetres (1495 mm = 58.86 in). This is the New Zealand-market 2024 MX-5 roadster listing (the NZ page cites VDA measurement), not a US Club figure; front track depends on wheel offset, so a US 17-inch Club may differ slightly. No US-market front track was seen. Read from search-result summary; page not opened."}},
