    induction: {"value":"natural","source":{"kind":"reference","name":"Kelley Blue Book (attribution uncertain)","url":"https://www.kbb.com/mazda/mx-5-miata/2024/club","asOf":"2026-11-24","note":"Carried over from the earlier card research (aspiration = naturally-aspirated): a search summary said 'All 2024 Mazda MX-5 models use a naturally aspirated 2.0-liter four-cylinder' and that the Club has the same engine as the other trims. The summary did not say which listed result carried the wording (KBB's Club page and Autoblog's Club buyer's guide were the results), so the attribution to KBB is not certain. The card reviewer marked it unconfirmed only because no result of theirs stated aspiration in words; nothing mentioned a turbo or supercharger. Mazda's own wording was not seen. Read from search-result summary; page not opened."}},
