    displacementL: {"value":2,"source":{"kind":"manufacturer","name":"Mazda North American Operations (Mazda USA Newsroom, 2024 MX-5 Miata Pricing and Packaging)","url":"https://news.mazdausa.com/2024-01-25-24MY-2024-Mazda-MX-5-Miata-Pricing-and-Packaging","asOf":"2026-11-24","note":"Carried over from the earlier card research: the release was summarized as 'a Skyactiv-G 2.0-liter four-cylinder engine' for all 2024 MX-5 Miata models. KBB's Club page (2.0-liter four-cylinder, shared by all trims) and California Drive Clean's 2024 MX-5 manual 2.0L listing agree. Read from search-result summary; page not opened."}},
