    compressionRatio: {"value":12,"source":{"kind":"reference","name":"auto-data.net","url":"https://www.auto-data.net/en/subaru-outback-vi-bt-facelift-2022-2.5i-182hp-awd-lineartronic-cvt-45841","asOf":"2026-11-24","note":"WEAK (database, not Subaru): search summary said 'Auto-data lists Compression ratio 12, and an older listing for the same engine gives 12:1', from its 2022-facelift Outback 2.5i 182 hp AWD Lineartronic listing and a 2019 Outback 2.5 182 hp listing; the summary did not say which of the two URLs carried which wording. Same FB25 182 hp engine and generation as the 2024 Premium, but not a 2024 page. Bore x stroke 94 x 90 mm on the same listings. Read from search-result summary; page not opened."}},
