    tyreFront: {"value":"225/65R17","source":{"kind":"reference","name":"Mavis Tires & Brakes (fitment page)","url":"https://www.mavis.com/vehicle/subaru/outback/2024/premium/","asOf":"2026-11-24","note":"Search summary: 'The 2024 Premium uses 225/65R17, and Mavis lists that as the standard OEM tire size.' Tires-Easy's 2024 Outback Premium fitment page is listed as 225/65-17 102H, and auto123's base and Touring listings give P225/65HR17 front and rear. Firestone's fitment lists the Premium at 225/65R17 with 35/33 psi (front/rear). Square fitment. No Subaru document stating the Premium's size surfaced. Read from search-result summary; page not opened."}},
    tyreRear: {"value":"225/65R17","source":{"kind":"reference","name":"Mavis Tires & Brakes (fitment page)","url":"https://www.mavis.com/vehicle/subaru/outback/2024/premium/","asOf":"2026-11-24","note":"Same as tyreFront: Mavis lists 225/65R17 as the standard OEM size for the 2024 Outback Premium; auto123's listings give the same P225/65HR17 size front and rear (square fitment). Tires-Easy's Premium page is listed as 225/65-17 102H. Read from search-result summary; page not opened."}},
