    id: "2024-tesla-model-3-long-range-awd",
    identity: {"year":2024,"make":"Tesla","model":"Model 3","trim":"Long Range AWD (2024 refresh, dual motor, single-speed 9.03:1, 235/45R18 all-season)","bodyClass":"sedan"},
    curbWeightLb: {"value":4030,"source":{"kind":"reference","name":"Motor Matchup","url":"https://www.motormatchup.com/catalog/Tesla/Model-3/2024/Long-Range-AWD","asOf":"2026-11-24","note":"Copied from earlier card research (2026-11-11). Motor Matchup's catalogue page for the 2024 Tesla Model 3 Long Range AWD lists a curb weight of 4,030 lb; Edmunds' 2024 Model 3 Long Range specs page was summarised as 4,030 lb for the AWD trim. Listing-site figure only: no 2024 US Tesla document and no instrumented-test weight surfaced. Other listings range 4,034-4,081 lb; see conflicts. Read from search-result summary; page not opened."}},
    weightDistFrontPct: {"value":50.5,"source":{"kind":"reference","name":"Motor Matchup","url":"https://www.motormatchup.com/catalog/Tesla/Model-3/2024/Long-Range-AWD","asOf":"2026-11-24","note":"Motor Matchup's 2024 Long Range AWD page: 'Weight Distribution: Front: 50.5% | Rear: 49.5%'. The summary warned the same page has some inconsistent drivetrain details. Tesla's axle masses surfaced only in the 2017-2023 manual (previous car), which work out close to 50/50; see conflicts. Read from search-result summary; page not opened."}},
    wheelbaseIn: {"value":113.2,"source":{"kind":"reference","name":"Yahoo Autos (spec listing)","url":"https://autos.yahoo.com/2024-tesla-model-3-information-162300022.html","asOf":"2026-11-24","note":"The 2024 Model 3 information-and-specs listing, which says 'The specs below are for the Long Range AWD version of the Model 3', gives a 113.2 in wheelbase; another summary attributed the same listing (also on AOL) to Road & Track. Autoblog's 2024 Long Range 4dr All Wheel Drive Sedan page and KBB's 2024 specs give the same 113.2 in. Tesla's 2017-2023 owner's manual lists 2,875 mm for the previous car; no 2024 Tesla dimension table surfaced. Read from search-result summary; page not opened."}},
    trackFrontIn: {"value":62.4,"source":{"kind":"reference","name":"iSeeCars","url":"https://www.iseecars.com/car/2024-tesla-model_3-dimensions","asOf":"2026-11-24","note":"iSeeCars' 2024 Model 3 dimensions list 'Front Track 62.4 in'. An auto-data.net listing for the refreshed Model 3 gave 'front track of 1584 mm 62.36 in' (exact auto-data page not identified in the summary). Tesla's 2017-2023 manual gives 1,580 mm for the previous car; see conflicts. Read from search-result summary; page not opened."}},
    trackRearIn: {"value":61.8,"source":{"kind":"reference","name":"iSeeCars","url":"https://www.iseecars.com/car/2024-tesla-model_3-dimensions","asOf":"2026-11-24","note":"iSeeCars' 2024 Model 3 dimensions show rear track 62.4 in on some variants and 'the AWD Long Range listing at 61.8 in rear track'. An auto-data.net listing for the refreshed Model 3 gave 'rear track of 1570 mm 61.81 in' (exact auto-data page not identified in the summary). See conflicts. Read from search-result summary; page not opened."}},
    lengthIn: {"value":185.8,"source":{"kind":"reference","name":"Yahoo Autos (spec listing)","url":"https://autos.yahoo.com/2024-tesla-model-3-information-162300022.html","asOf":"2026-11-24","note":"Listing states its specs are 'for the Long Range AWD version of the Model 3' and gives a length of about 185.8 in; Edmunds and Autoblog's 2024 Long Range 4dr All Wheel Drive Sedan page give the same figure. Read from search-result summary; page not opened."}},
    widthIn: {"value":72.8,"source":{"kind":"reference","name":"Autoblog","url":"https://www.autoblog.com/buy/2024-Tesla-Model+3-Long_Range__4dr_All_Wheel_Drive_Sedan/specs/","asOf":"2026-11-24","note":"Autoblog's 2024 Model 3 Long Range 4dr All Wheel Drive Sedan page gives a body width of about 72.8 in without mirrors; Edmunds' 2024 Long Range specs give the same 72.8 in without mirrors and 82.2 in with mirrors (KBB also 82.2 in with mirrors). This is body width excluding mirrors. See conflicts. Read from search-result summary; page not opened."}},
    heightIn: {"value":56.7,"source":{"kind":"reference","name":"Yahoo Autos (spec listing)","url":"https://autos.yahoo.com/2024-tesla-model-3-information-162300022.html","asOf":"2026-11-24","note":"The Long Range AWD spec listing and Autoblog's 2024 Long Range AWD page both give a height of about 56.7 in; EVSpecifications lists 56.8 in. Read from search-result summary; page not opened."}},
    groundClearanceIn: {"value":5.4,"source":{"kind":"manufacturer","name":"Tesla (Model 3 Owner's Manual)","url":"https://www.tesla.com/ownersmanual/model3/en_eu/GUID-56562137-FC31-4110-A13C-9A9FC6657BF0.html","asOf":"2026-11-24","note":"Copied from earlier card research (2026-11-11). The owner's manual dimension table was summarised as 'Ground Clearance 5.4 in / 138 mm' for the Rear-Wheel Drive / Long Range configuration (Performance 5.0 in). EU-English edition of the current (2024+) manual, not a US page; Tesla's Saudi Model 3 page gives 138 mm for the non-Performance cars. Read from search-result summary; page not opened."}},
