    finalDriveRatio: {"value":9.03,"source":{"kind":"manufacturer","name":"Tesla (Model 3 Owner's Manual, Subsystems section)","url":"https://www.tesla.com/OWNERSMANUAL/model3/en_cn/GUID-E414862C-CFA1-4A0B-9548-BE21C32CAA58.html","asOf":"2026-11-24","note":"'Gearbox Ratio 9.03:1' with 'Type: Single speed fixed gear', in a table covering Long Range AWD. This is the whole motor-to-wheel reduction (the only ratio published); EVSpecifications gives 'Axle ratio: 9.03' for the Long Range AWD. The manual shows one ratio, not separate front and rear figures; Motor Matchup lists 'Final Drive: 9' for both motors. China-English edition, not US. Read from search-result summary; page not opened."}},
