    tyreFront: {"value":"235/45R18","source":{"kind":"reference","name":"Goodyear (fitment guide)","url":"https://www.goodyear.com/en-us/vehicles/Tesla/Model-3/2024/Long-Range","asOf":"2026-11-24","note":"Goodyear's page for the 2024 Model 3 Long Range lists 235/45R18; Big O Tires gives 18-inch wheels with 235/45R18 as original equipment (19-inch option 235/40R19), and Firestone's chart shows 235/45R18 W for the 2024 Long Range. Tesla's own 18-inch Photon wheel package lists 235/45R18 on an 18x8.5J wheel. Sources give one size for all four corners. Read from search-result summary; page not opened."}},
