    powertrain: {"value":"gasoline","source":{"kind":"manufacturer","name":"Toyota USA Newsroom","url":"https://pressroom.toyota.com/2024-toyota-rav4-go-wild-in-style/","asOf":"2026-11-24","note":"Copied from the card research (engine/data/research/batch-2-2026-11-11.json). (fuelType) Toyota's 2024 RAV4 release refers to the 2.5L engine on 'all gas grades', of which XLE is one; the hybrid is a separate model line. The checker's EPA-derived listing (CarWhere) gives 'Regular Gasoline' for the 2.5L AWD automatic. Read from search-result summary; page not opened."}},
