    cylinders: {"value":4,"source":{"kind":"reference","name":"Kelley Blue Book","url":"https://www.kbb.com/toyota/rav4/2024/xle","asOf":"2026-11-24","note":"Copied from the card research (engine/data/research/batch-2-2026-11-11.json). KBB lists '4-Cyl' for the 2024 RAV4 XLE; Edmunds says 2.5-liter four-cylinder across the gas trims. Read from search-result summary; page not opened."}},
    horsepower: {"value":203,"source":{"kind":"reference","name":"Edmunds","url":"https://www.edmunds.com/toyota/rav4/2024/st-401994384/features-specs","asOf":"2026-11-24","note":"Copied from the card research (engine/data/research/batch-2-2026-11-11.json). Edmunds lists the 2024 RAV4 2.5-liter four-cylinder at 203 horsepower across the gas trims; cars.com XLE pages list the same; the checker found Motor Matchup's 2024 XLE AWD entry at '203 hp @ 6,600 rpm'. No Toyota-published horsepower page appeared in the results. Read from search-result summary; page not opened."}},
    horsepowerRpm: {"value":6600,"source":{"kind":"reference","name":"Motor Matchup","url":"https://www.motormatchup.com/catalog/Toyota/RAV4/2024/XLE-AWD-(Natl)","asOf":"2026-11-24","note":"The card research's checker read Motor Matchup's 2024 RAV4 XLE AWD entry as '203 hp @ 6,600 rpm'. In this pass the search summary said multiple 2024 listings (Auto123's 2024 XLE, LE and Limited among the results) give '203 hp@6600' for the non-hybrid trims, Cars.com's 2024 Limited page gives 203 hp at 6600 rpm, and auto-data's A25A-FKS listing gives the same 6,600 rpm peak. No Toyota page surfaced. Read from search-result summary; page not opened."}},
