    torqueRpmLow: {"value":5000,"source":{"kind":"reference","name":"Motor Matchup","url":"https://www.motormatchup.com/catalog/Toyota/RAV4/2024/XLE-AWD-(Natl)","asOf":"2026-11-24","note":"The card research's checker read Motor Matchup's 2024 RAV4 XLE AWD entry as '184 lb-ft @ 5,000 rpm'; in this pass the search summary said multiple 2024 listings (Auto123 2024 XLE among them) give '184 lb-ft@5000', and auto-data's A25A-FKS listing gives 183.65 lb-ft @ 5000 rpm. Only a single peak-torque speed is published, so it is recorded as both low and high. Read from search-result summary; page not opened."}},
    torqueRpmHigh: {"value":5000,"source":{"kind":"reference","name":"Motor Matchup","url":"https://www.motormatchup.com/catalog/Toyota/RAV4/2024/XLE-AWD-(Natl)","asOf":"2026-11-24","note":"Same single-point figure as torqueRpmLow: '184 lb-ft @ 5,000 rpm' (Motor Matchup 2024 XLE AWD; Auto123 2024 XLE). No plateau was published, so the upper end equals the peak speed. Read from search-result summary; page not opened."}},
    redlineRpm: {"value":7400,"source":{"kind":"reference","name":"Motor Matchup","url":"https://www.motormatchup.com/catalog/Toyota/RAV4/2024/TRD-Off-Road-AWD-(GS)","asOf":"2026-11-24","note":"The search summary said Motor Matchup's 2024 RAV4 TRD Off-Road AWD page gives a redline of 7,400 rpm, the only redline figure found. That page is a different trim, but the 2024 gas RAV4 has one engine (2.5L, 203 hp, 184 lb-ft) and one 8-speed automatic across all gas grades, so the engine's redline is shared; still single-source and not tied to an XLE page. No Toyota figure surfaced. Read from search-result summary; page not opened."}},
