    horsepower: {"value":278,"source":{"kind":"manufacturer","name":"Toyota USA Newsroom","url":"https://pressroom.toyota.com/all-new-2024-toyota-tacoma-is-adventure-ready-out-of-the-box/","asOf":"2026-11-24","note":"'The turbocharged i-FORCE 2.4-liter engine produces up to 278 horsepower and 317 lb.-ft. of torque'; the MY24 overview lists 278 hp for the TRD grades with the 8-speed automatic. The same trim with the 6-speed manual is rated 270 hp, so 278 hp is right only for this automatic configuration. Read from search-result summary; page not opened."}},
